---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="About MrCompress - Secure & Private Image Compression"
	description="Learn how MrCompress provides secure, local image compression and conversion. Everything happens in your browser, ensuring your privacy."
>
	<section class="py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-12 text-center">About MrCompress</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-body">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
				<p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-lg">
					MrCompress was born out of a simple need: a fast, free, and secure way to optimize images without the fear of data being harvested or images being stored on unknown servers. We believe that privacy shouldn't be a premium feature.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-16">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Modern Tech Stack</h3>
						<p class="leading-relaxed">
							We leverage the power of modern web technologies like <strong>Astro</strong>, <strong>React</strong>, and <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong> to provide a seamless user experience. By using the <strong>Web Canvas API</strong> and <strong>Web Workers</strong>, we perform complex image manipulations directly in your browser.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Privacy by Design</h3>
						<p class="leading-relaxed">
							Unlike other online tools, MrCompress does not have a backend that handles your images. When you select a file, it never leaves your computer. This architecture ensures maximum speed and absolute privacy.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline shadow-v-1">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-6">Why Choose MrCompress?</h3>
					<ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 list-none pl-0">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-geist-success/10 flex items-center justify-center">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-geist-success"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
							</div>
							<span class="font-medium">100% Client-Side Processing</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-geist-success/10 flex items-center justify-center">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-geist-success"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
							</div>
							<span class="font-medium">No Registration Required</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-geist-success/10 flex items-center justify-center">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-geist-success"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
							</div>
							<span class="font-medium">Supports HEIC & PDF to Image</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-geist-success/10 flex items-center justify-center">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-geist-success"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
							</div>
							<span class="font-medium">Completely Free Forever</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
